h-text","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>In 1932, the first pair of Bloch pointe shoes were handcrafted in Sydney. Our Heritage pointe shoe, born in 2007, continues to honour the legacy of that very first pair. To this day, it remains one of our best-selling, most loved and trusted styles, crafted by hand with a streamlined silhouette and a line-lengthening v-shaped vamp. Also available in a hard shank and a variety of satin shades to complement your skin tone.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","url_style":"button_1","enlarge_title":false,"enlarge_text":true,"full_width":true,"color_bg":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","color_title":"#333333","color_text":"#333333","text-align":"text-center","padding-top":0,"padding-bottom":0}},"multicolumn_rTmHQh":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"column_PAHFJU":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Heritage_1080x1350_TonalProductCampaign_GroupShots_ActionShots_0458.jpg","title":"Part of the Tonal Pointe Shoe range","text":"<p>Heritage comes in our tonal satin shades, developed in collaboration with leading professional dancers from the Bloch community, to complement a variety of skin tones.<\/p>","column_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/heritage-pointe-shoes"}},"column_gULrYH":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Heritage_1080x1350_CR6_2608_edited.jpg","title":"Strengths","text":"<p>The flexible, supportive, and durable shank is perfect for rehearsal and performance. Its medium strength and curved design enhance foot articulation and aid in rolling through demi pointe.<\/p>","column_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/heritage-pointe-shoes"}},"column_xdiUEf":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Heritage_1080x1350_layflat.jpg","title":"Engineered for success","text":"<p>Noise-reducing pleats under the box ensure a smooth surface and stability for running, walking, or standing. The improved cupped heel with a heel counter offers a secure, snug fit, helping maintain the shoe's shape when the foot is standing flat or en pointe.<\/p>","column_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/heritage-pointe-shoes"}}},"block_order":["column_PAHFJU","column_gULrYH","column_xdiUEf"],"settings":{"title":"","intro":"","image_width":"full","column_alignment":"left","color_bg":"#ffffff","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"video_xkGzYf":{"type":"video","settings":{"video_url":"https:\/\/youtu.be\/EkuyyPLQTCU","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Your_paragraph_text_1.jpg","image_position":"center center","color_overlay_bg":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","overlay_opacity":80,"color_overlay_text":"#ffffff","overlay_title":"See it in action","overlay_text":"","enlarge_title":true,"enlarge_text":false,"overlay_position_x":50,"overlay_position_y":50,"mobile_text_below":false}},"featured_collection_ka8efH":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"Inclusive shades to complement a variety of skin tones","enlarge_title":false,"link_text":"","collection":"heritage-pointe-shoes","show_vendor":false,"enable_carousel":true,"grid":4,"row_count":1,"grid_mobile":"2","padding-top":0,"padding-bottom":0}},"testimonials_WRgWmE":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"testimonial_bL96T8":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"star_rating":5,"testimonial":"<p>“I love the v-cut of the Bloch Heritage because it allows my foot to give a sleek and longer look and enhance the arches of my feet when I'm on pointe. They're comfortable and reliable, especially when I need to wear pointe shoes for a long amount of time.”<\/p>","author":"Mayu Odaka, Oklahoma City Ballet"}},"testimonial_xgGtAH":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"star_rating":5,"testimonial":"<p>“The sleek style of the shoe fits my foot like a glove while providing just the right amount of lift and support for pirouettes or hops en pointe.”<\/p>","author":"Elisabeth Beyer - Corps de Ballet, American Ballet Theatre"}},"testimonial_dxP47Q":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"star_rating":5,"testimonial":"<p>“I've been wearing my customized 